		### A colony's page (sr_colony_view 'detail', sr_colony_focus its key;
		### colony management design § 8, rebuilt on the owner's review of
		### 2026-10-30): the list's parts give way to sections, each a heading
		### with its control on the right and its readings in tiles two to a row
		### (te_sr_page_tile), and the modules one to a line with their icons and
		### full names (te_sr_page_mod_row). Every figure, hover and button is the
		### list's own block, filled again here.
		flowcontainer = {
			visible = "[And( EqualTo_CFixedPoint( JournalEntry.GetCountry.MakeScope.ScriptValue('sr_disp_colonies_contested'), '(CFixedPoint)1' ), GetVariableSystem.HasValue('sr_colony_view', 'detail') )]"
