	### Colony Fleets (solar colonization; slices 2-3 design §§ 3, 8): where our
	### next colony fleet goes, as a value row with Clear beside our target
	### (sr_cf_target_clear_sgui; audit SPC-7), the drive it flies on
	### ([concept_sr_drive]), and under simple and full colonies our colony fleets
	### in flight, one row per slot. Change and Choose open the colony target
	### popup (te_sr_target_popup; UI pass design § 5). Open by default; the
	### flag is sr_panel_fleets_closed.
	type te_sr_sec_colony_fleets = flowcontainer {
